«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  PoissAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "PoissAll: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → λv Xv « λv 0 + Xv 0 + → λ X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X>λ+40*√(λ);1;Σ(Jx;0;IP(X);(λ^Jx)*EXP(-λ)/Jx!)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X>λ+40*√(λ);0;(λ^IP(X))*EXP(-λ)/(IP(X)!)))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'λ' →Num "μ" →Tag '√(λ)' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE λv Xv 2 →List Drop » »
»
